         return true // Replace with actual implementation
     }
 }

In this solution, the function `suggestionForGlutenIssues` provides direct advice on how to handle gluten-related issues for someone experiencing significant fatigue. The recommendation is to take supplements and adopt a gluten-free diet immediately, without waiting for confirmatory tests if noticeable improvements occur from these lifestyle changes.

